  "description": "Get ready for a thrilling ride with the all-new Nitrous Bikes, where adventure meets vibrant fun! Designed for kids ages 6-12 years, these kids’ bikes come in exciting colors that spark joy and encourage time outdoors. Assembly is a breeze—you can get those pedals turning quickly, so your little adventurers can hit the road in no time! The quick-release saddle makes it easy to adjust as they grow, and the included tools ensure you're prepared for assembly. Safety takes center stage with front and coaster brakes for reliable stopping power. Plus, with a handy water bottle holder and a cheerful handlebar bell, every ride is a celebration. The Nitrous kids’ bikes by Dynacraft come in 16-inch, 18-inch, and 20-inch sizes. These boys’ and girls’ bikes also feature radiant red, blue, black, and teal paint finishes. The 16” and 18” bikes feature adjustable training wheels to boost confidence and encourage exploration, while the 20” Nitrous comes equipped with a kickstand for riders who can cruise without training wheels.",
